  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Development Bank                            Core Environment Programme                        Phase 1 2007-2012 - GMS-Init, uppf/studier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Asian Development Bank                            Core Environment Programme                        Phase 1 2007-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar dels till integrering av milj&#xf6;h&#xe4;nsyn i regionala policies f&#xf6;r investeringar i infrastruktur, dels till lokalt engagemang och medbest&#xe4;mmande i aktiviteter f&#xf6;r skydd av  biodiversitet och h&#xe5;llbart bruk av ekosystem. Ett koordinerande kontor, EOC, f&#xf6;r samordning st&#xf6;ds genom programmet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme has two complementary components: 1) Core Environment Program CEP is aimed at influencing the infrastructure investment policy in the region towards integrating and addressing environmental concerns in the long term. 2) Biodiversity Conservation Corridors Initiative BCI is directed towards involving civil society and local groups in biodiversity conservation and sustainable use of ecosystems</narrative>
  </description>
